@startuml Receiver Registration Process

title Process: registering and suspending a Receiver
caption Target design. Decisions D22, D30, D35, D33, P11. Plan 04.

|Ground Officer|
start
:Create the Receiver (organisation, region);
:Record its address and contact\n(sensitive, Ground Officer only);

|Freedom|
:Status: Pending;
note right: nothing records what kind of body it is (D33)

|Administrator|
if (Register it?) then (yes)
  :Set status Registered;
  |Dispatcher|
  :Use it as a box destination\nor a vehicle's handover Receiver;
else (no)
  |Freedom|
  :Refuse it as a destination;
  stop
endif

|Administrator|
if (Later suspend or expire it?) then (yes)
  :Review where it is used\n(convoys and boxes, no address);
  :Set status Suspended or Expired;
  |Freedom|
  :Its allocations now fail a blocking requirement;
  :Declarations naming it become stale;
  |Dispatcher|
  :Reallocate, or wait for re-registration;
else (no)
endif
stop

@enduml
